<title>USA: Digital Link names new president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Digital Link names new president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Link Corp said Monday it has appointed Alan Fraser president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Fraser replaces Vinita Gupta, founder and current chief executive, who will remain as chairman of the board, the company said.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Digital Link, Fraser, was president of MicroUnity Systems Engineering Inc of Sunnyvale.</p>
